# The module's runtime store, anchored to this directory. Written as "data/" until 23 Oct
# 2026, which matches a directory of that name at ANY depth -- so tests/data/, which holds
# the OCR text a ledger test reads, was silently untracked and that test could only pass on
# the machine the fixture was made on.
/data/
logs/
*.egg-info/
